Package: ezmonitor
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: KDE Plasma 6 panel widget for APsystems EZ1 solar power monitoring
 EZMonitor queries an APsystems EZ1 microinverter's local JSON API and
 shows live solar panel power output and daily yield in the Plasma panel.
 No cloud service involved, all data stays local.
